  data: {
    LLM: "If your hand is weak but contains a lone 10, try to play it on your partner's lead early to guarantee it isn't 'filtered' out by the opponents.\n\nThe Throw-in: Use the 'no trumps, no count' rule strategically to reset a hand where the opponents likely have all the power cards.\n\nDefensive Pitching: If you have a poor hand, pitch a suit where you hold a 'bobby' (low card) in hopes that your partner can dominate with the High or Jack.",
    Player: "If your hand is weak but contains a lone 10, try to play it on your partner's lead early to guarantee it isn't 'filtered' out by the opponents.\n\nThe Throw-in: Use the 'no trumps, no count' rule strategically to reset a hand where the opponents likely have all the power cards.\n\nDefensive Pitching: If you have a poor hand, pitch a suit where you hold a 'bobby' (low card) in hopes that your partner can dominate with the High or Jack.",
